      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The hamlet of Haines Falls has always been a mountain resort town, unlike nearby Hunter and Palenville, which had tanneries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
